# Release assembly
/release/
/.sdk-gate-evidence/
/.native-equivalence/

# Compiler and generator output is confined to the build roots above. Do not
# ignore by extension: immutable upstream conformance corpora may legitimately
# contain C, IR, generated Rust, Lean object, or `.out` fixture files, and a
# fresh clone must preserve their byte-complete trees.

# The sole reviewed generated-output exception. Its manifest binds every
# generated Lean file to source, compiler semantics, and exact hashes.
!/tests/golden/stdlib/
!/tests/golden/stdlib/**

# Editor and OS
/sdk/oracles/node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/

# These directories are immutable upstream source, not local editor state.
